<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102265" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰμῐ-εία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stewardship, management</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				806a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				7.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.32<i>B</i>64
			</span></i> (Olbia, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1326.37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῆς τροφῆς τ</span>. the
				<i>storing</i> of food, by ants, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				622b26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ψυχροῦ καὶ θερμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>office of treasurer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1309b7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			= Lat. <i>quaestura</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				4.1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταμιείᾳ</span> (corr. Daremberg for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταμιεῖαν</span>) is dat. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταμίας</span>, <i>housekeeper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				5.6
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταμιείᾳ πολιτικῶν
			λημμάτων</span> is written (hypercorrectly) for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταμίᾳ π. λ</span>. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				934
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
